      "section": "cards",
      "rank": 100,
      "title": "AwardWallet: Citi ThankYou 10% transfer bonus to Cathay Asia Miles ends Nov. 14",
      "summary": "AwardWallet reports Citi ThankYou Points transfers to Cathay Asia Miles earn a 10% bonus through 11:59 p.m. ET on Nov. 14, 2026. Minimum transfer is 1,000 points in 1,000-point increments; eligible premium cards receive 1,100 Asia Miles per 1,000 points, while select no-annual-fee cards receive 770 per 1,000. The report cites awards such as 58,000 Citi points for British Airways business class from New York to London. Terms were not officially confirmed.",
      "verification": "reported",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-10-25T11:00:09.000Z",
      "effectiveAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "publisher": "AwardWallet",
          "url": "https://awardwallet.com/news/citi-thankyou-rewards/cathay-pacific-transfer-bonus/",
          "sourceType": "editorial",
          "publishedAt": "2026-10-25T11:00:09.000Z",
          "retrievedAt": "2026-10-25T14:01:47.803Z"
        }
      ],
      "terms": {
        "issuer": "Citi",
        "program": "Citi ThankYou to Cathay Asia Miles",
        "merchant": null,
        "rewardType": "miles",
        "minSpend": null,
        "creditAmount": null,
        "rewardPoints": null,
        "activationRequired": null,
        "activateBy": null
      },
      "expiresAt": "2026-11-15T04:59:59.000Z",
      "firstSeenAt": "2026-10-25T14:03:51.877Z",
      "changedAt": "2026-10-25T14:03:51.877Z",
      "sourceRunId": "f6d01cc2-6b9b-40cd-a832-2b591cf65ca9",
      "changeType": "new",
      "active": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "AwardWallet reports that Citi ThankYou cardholders can receive 10% extra Cathay Asia Miles on point transfers through 11:59 p.m. Eastern on Nov. 14, 2026. The minimum transfer is 1,000 ThankYou Points, moved in 1,000-point increments, and transfers to Asia Miles normally post instantly. Cardholders with the Citi Strata Elite, Citi Strata Premier, Citi Prestige or AT&T Access More Card get 1,100 Asia Miles per 1,000 points; select no-annual-fee Citi cards get 770 per 1,000.",
        "The report highlights several uses: 58,000 Citi points covers a 63,000-mile British Airways business-class award from New York JFK to London Heathrow with $235.51 in taxes and fees; 83,000 points covers a 91,000-mile Cathay Pacific business-class award from San Francisco to Hong Kong; and 109,000 points covers a 119,000-mile Los Angeles-to-Sydney business-class itinerary via Hong Kong. It also cites Royal Air Maroc New York-Casablanca awards at 25,000 Citi points in economy or 58,000 in business, and Hong Kong-Seoul Cathay business class at 25,000 Citi points."
      ],
      "keyPoints": [
        "Promotion runs through 11:59 p.m. ET on Nov. 14, 2026; minimum transfer is 1,000 ThankYou Points in 1,000-point increments.",
        "Eligible premium Citi cards receive 1,100 Asia Miles per 1,000 ThankYou Points; select no-annual-fee Citi cards receive 770 per 1,000, per AwardWallet.",
        "AwardWallet examples include 58,000 Citi points for British Airways business class JFK-LHR at 63,000 Asia Miles plus $235.51 in taxes and fees, and 83,000 points for Cathay business class SFO-HKG at 91,000 miles."
      ],
      "takeaway": "Check award availability for the specific Cathay Pacific or partner flight first, then transfer only the ThankYou Points needed in 1,000-point increments before 11:59 p.m. ET on Nov. 14, 2026. Confirm the taxes and fees shown for that award before transferring."
    },
