      "title": "Costco again sells Uber and DoorDash eGift cards at 20% off",
      "summary": "Doctor of Credit reports that Costco.com is again selling Uber and DoorDash eGift cards at a 20% discount. Online purchases are limited to $200 per brand every 14 days. An Oct. 25 update says most Costco warehouses appear to be stocking them again. The report cites an Uber Eats release describing the 20% gift card partnership as limited-time; no end date is stated.",
