      "changeType": "new",
      "active": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Doctor of Credit reports that Costco.com has resumed offering Uber and DoorDash eGift cards at a 20% discount. The reported online purchase cap is $200 per brand every 14 days, and an Oct. 25 update says most warehouse locations appear to have them in stock again.",
        "The report says Costco had stopped carrying the cards for several months. It also points to an Uber Eats release that describes the 20% gift card partnership as limited-time, but the report does not provide an expiration date."
      ],
      "keyPoints": [
        "20% discount on Uber and DoorDash eGift cards through Costco",
        "Online limit reported at $200 per brand every 14 days",
        "Uber Eats release cited by Doctor of Credit calls the partnership limited-time; no end date given"
      ],
      "takeaway": "If you use Uber or DoorDash, check Costco.com or a local Costco warehouse. Online purchases are capped at $200 per brand every 14 days."
